[{"i":"8440","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列能增强模型稳定性的做法有哪些？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>多采用三角形结构</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>使模型与地面的接触面积增大</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>多采用四边形结构</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>使模型与地面的接触面积减小</span></p>"}],"a":"A,B","an":"<p>分析结构的几何特性对稳定性的影响，考虑形状在受力时的形变趋势；考察支撑面与重心位置的关系，判断接触面积变化对支撑效果的作用；比较不同多边形结构在承载和抗变形方面的力学表现；识别哪些因素可能提升结构对外界扰动的抵抗能力。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知"]},{"i":"8441","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">关于手摇把手说法正确的有？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>是轮轴省力的应用</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>是轮轴费力的应用</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>是杠杆的变形</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>是滑轮的变形</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>分析手摇把手的机械结构，观察其是否由轮和轴组成并围绕共同轴线旋转，判断其是否利用轮轴原理实现力的传递与转换；考察轮与轴半径差异对输入力与输出力关系的影响，确定是否存在省力或费力效应；分析整体构造是否存在支点、力臂、阻力臂等要素，判断其是否符合杠杆原理的变形特征；对比滑轮的工作机制，确认其是否具备改变拉力方向或分担负载的特性，排除或确认其与滑轮结构的关联性。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["省力杠杆和费力杠杆","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]},{"i":"8442","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">关于烤肉架模型说法正确的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>两个相邻的齿轮转向相同</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>两个相邻的齿轮转向相反</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>齿轮越大，它的旋转中心轴转的越慢</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>齿轮越大，它的旋转中心轴转的越快</span></p>"}],"a":"B,C","an":"<p>分析齿轮传动系统中相邻齿轮的转向关系，需观察啮合点处的齿面作用力方向，相邻齿轮因相互啮合导致旋转方向相反。分析齿轮尺寸与转速关系时，基于节圆线速度相等原则，两齿轮啮合时角速度与半径成反比，因此较大齿轮对应较低角速度。通过几何约束和运动传递规律，确定转向特性与尺寸对转速的影响机制。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"8443","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">关于齿轮传动说法正确的有？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>大齿轮带动小齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>大齿轮带动小齿轮起减速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">所有齿轮组的传动比都是</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1:1</font></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">两个同样大小的齿轮啮合传动比是</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1:1</font></span></p>"}],"a":"A,D","an":"<p>分析齿轮传动时，需明确主动轮与从动轮的齿数关系。传动比由两齿轮齿数的反比决定。当主动轮齿数多于从动轮时，输出转速增加；当主动轮齿数少于从动轮时，输出转速降低。若两齿轮齿数相等，则输入与输出转速相同。啮合齿轮的旋转方向相反，但不影响传动比计算。传动功能取决于齿数差异，而非单一齿轮大小或数量。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"8444","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>搭建说明</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>请考生制作一个手动烤肉架模型。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>搭建要求</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(a) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备手动烤肉架模型大体框架；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(b) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备依次啮合的齿轮（至少三个）；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(c) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备手摇把手，每个齿轮上有一个长轴表示用于烤肉的部件；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(d) </font><font face=\"宋体\">缓慢旋转手摇把手，各长轴旋转；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(e) </font><font face=\"宋体\">整体动作流畅。</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>器材说明</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>案例样图</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><o:p></o:p></span><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"text-align: center;\">1</font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-01/8489866753516724224.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-01/8489866753629970432.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">3</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-01/8489866753764188160.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">4</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-01/8489866753873240064.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-01/8489866753986486272.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-01/8489866754074566656.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>","o":[],"a":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>评分</span></b><b><span>说明</span></b><b><span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>1、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">整体框架（</font>40分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>1)作品零件结构是否和样例模型基本一致、结构完整</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">，具备</font><font face=\"宋体\">①手摇把手、②三个齿轮</font></span><span>及以上</span><span>构成</span><span>的</span><span>依次</span><span>啮合的齿轮组</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">、</font><font face=\"宋体\">③有</font></span><span>三根及以上长轴表示烤肉的部件</span><span>，以上每缺少一点扣</span><span>10</span><span>分，缺少两点及两点以上扣</span><span>20</span><span>分。（</span><span>20</span><span>分）</span><span><br></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>(</span><span>2)作品相应部件的固定可靠程度</span><span>；</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>10分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>3)作品的整体协调性和美观性。（10分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>2、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">动力传递</font>/表现形式（30分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>1)</span><span>摇动手摇</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">把手，所有的</font><font face=\"宋体\">“</font></span><span>烤肉</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">棍</font><font face=\"宋体\">”</font></span><span>旋转；</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>15分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>2)作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>3、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">完成时间（</font>10分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>在考试时间内完成得</span><span>10</span><span>分，超时</span><span>1</span><span>分钟扣</span><span>1</span><span>分。（</span><span>10</span><span>分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>超时</span><span>10</span><span>分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为</span><span>0</span><span>分。</span></p>","an":"","sc":80.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念","基本结构认知"]}]